I come to my building.
I have three big cloth bags in my hands.
Those bags are very full.
They are very heavy.
I walk slowly.
My neighbour Asha is there.
Asha sees me.
She quickly comes near me.
"Maya, do you want help?" she asks.
"Yes, Asha."
"I want help," I say.
Asha takes one bag from my hands.
It is the heaviest bag.
"This bag is very heavy!" Asha says.
"There is rice and dal in the bag," I say.
"Thank you, Asha," I say.
We climb the stairs together.
Asha helps me a lot.
I like my new friend a lot.
